{"t":"Burst Arrow","s":"burst-arrow-0a5f0","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Burst_Arrow_12554b.gif","q":3,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Burst Arrow</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Burst Arrow\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Burst_Arrow_12554b.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"levelrequired\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Combat Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"attack\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Attack</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">27</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"hit_chance\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><abbr title=\"Maximum hit chance before any bow/crossbow hit chance modifier.\">Max Hit Chance</abbr></h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">100%</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Weapons<br/>Ammunition</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"pickupable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickupable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"weight\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Weight</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0.90 oz</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"stackable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Stackable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Trade Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">15 - 25 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not bought by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not sold by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">4.0<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">May 20, 1998<br/>Beta 4.0</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20150720234318&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Burst_Arrow_12554b.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a burst arrow.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 0.90 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>You can never miss your target with burst arrows, even with a distance skill of 10, since the explosion effect will always take place regardless of damage output or accuracy %. Burst arrows damage a 9 square area centered on the targeted monster or, in case of a miss, wherever it lands. They use your Distance skill to cause Physical damage. Their damage output is about the same as that of a <a href=\"#/wiki/Bolt\">bolt</a>. <a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin\">Paladins</a> can create 8 of them with the Conjure Explosive Arrow spell. A player with a Black Skull cannot use Burst Arrows. May be useful for paladins who fight creatures which come in packs, as it has a 100% hit rate to a direct target, and may still deal damage to nearby foes. This has its consequences, too, as in PvP worlds the burst arrow will hit players even if the paladin doesn't mean to.\n</p><p>During big team hunts in Hardcore PvP worlds, Paladins can attack their tank to do 9 square meters of damage to all surrounding monsters in case they are unable to use <a href=\"#/wiki/Diamond%20Arrow\">Diamond Arrows</a> or they simply don't have enough of them.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-object-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>Before Tibia version 8.0, the damage caused by Burst Arrows was based upon your level and magic level, so they were used primarily by <a href=\"#/wiki/Druid\">Druids</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Sorcerer\">Sorcerers</a>. They were also frequently used in the <a href=\"#/quest/the-annihilator-quest\">Annihilator Quest</a>. Burst Arrow damage is now based upon your Distance skill, so these days they are used almost exclusively by <a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin\">Paladins</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Arthom%20the%20Hunter\">Arthom the Hunter</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Destroyer\">Destroyer</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">Dragon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Grand%20Mother%20Foulscale\">Grand Mother Foulscale</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Hunter\">Hunter</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Infernoid%20Soul\">Infernoid Soul</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Infernoid%20Spiritual\">Infernoid Spiritual</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Omruc\">Omruc</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Wyrm\">Wyrm</a></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li>Ammunition</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Arthom%20the%20Hunter\">Arthom the Hunter</a></li><li>Attack Effects</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/beggar-outfits-quest\">Beggar Outfits Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bolt\">Bolt</a></li><li>Bosses</li><li>Bow Ammunition</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Breach%20Brood\">Breach Brood</a></li><li>Burst Arrow Missile</li><li>Conjure Explosive Arrow</li><li>Demons</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Destroyer\">Destroyer</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Diamond%20Arrow\">Diamond Arrow</a></li><li>Distance Weapons</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">Dragon</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/dragon-tower-quest\">Dragon Tower Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragons\">Dragons</a></li><li>Explosion Effect</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Flash%20Arrow\">Flash Arrow</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Grand%20Mother%20Foulscale\">Grand Mother Foulscale</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Hellflayer\">Hellflayer</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Hunter\">Hunter</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Imbuing\">Imbuing</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Infernalist\">Infernalist</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Infernoid%20Soul\">Infernoid Soul</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Infernoid%20Spiritual\">Infernoid Spiri